{arial}Fenek Mobile Antenna 
Operator: Sergeant Tonedef

from: {arialbld}Kurt Rorscham{arial}
Port Tangiers








What's with this request for a 48 hour leave to participate in the Camel Derby of {arialbld}Casa Blanca{arial}? What kind of an idiot do you take me for {name}? I didn't send you down there to goof off on the back of some camel. I doubt the Psychos will let us hang around much after their latest spanking ...


{ia10}{offset110}The chief of the rebels (opposite) is called {arialbld}Bob Renard{arial}. He is 44 years old. 
First enlisted in Jaffar as a mercenary, this Normo adventurer joined Sheikh Youssef Al Khadin's service as Captain of the Guard, then soon became his top military advisor, and finally the Sheikh's very own son-in-law through marriage with his daughter Shaïness.{offset0}







Thanks to this man and his handful of rebels, Otton Von Tekton's Elephants have been pinned down at the Kesselrine pass. This Bob Renard has turned into a real popular hero, the Jaffaris have come to call him the {arialbld}Desert Fox{arial}.

Karlo Von Tekton has received some heavy bombers at {arialbld}El Gazara{arial}, so the Kalamata plateau is now in full range of his airdromes in the Chaffarine Islands. Tektons don't know jack about hunting foxes with the subtlety as you Normos - they will trap him in his burrow using the steamroller.


{arialbld}PAY ATTENTION NOW:{arial}

Your job is to conquer {arialbld}El Gazara{arial} in the east and then land on the Chaffarine Islands and annihilate these airdromes. 

Mine is to advance up the northern road to {arialbld}Cap Zoar{arial} so as to pull the rug from under Tankred's crutches.
 
Alex Kolman, always attentive to your little needs, has supplied you with four of our best "fire-spitter" fighters(seen below).













{center}{device30}















A final ultra-confidential matter, you are ordered to bet 100 Dinars for me at the Camel Derby on Zephyra, I know her odds are eight to one so don't try to pull a fast one on me.


{offset50}Commander of the 1st Schyzo Army at Jaffar

{arialbld}Kurt Rorscham{arial}



